-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T18:48:01-07:00","id":968299,"title":"","content":"1E The Fair Folk, pg 232, Box: Fair Folk Thaumatury, second paragraph. Xarbala.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12392-alabrax","name":"Alabrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12392_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T14:22:36-07:00","id":970915,"title":"","content":"Hey, I'm Adam. Last name unpronounceable if you are just reading it. (DAMN YOU MELTING POT!) I'm from the middle of fly over country, but have been bouncing over the US since I graduated high school. For anyone who has read Running With the Demon I'm actually from &quot;Hopewell&quot;. It's not as interesting as it sounds. After finishing up with the military I came back home for a while and haven't had a reason to leave yet.<br /> <br /> After growing up with a diet of Chick Tracks and fire/brimstone sermons I had my first RPG game around '02ish. Haven't looked back since even though, at the time, all anyone seemed to want to do is some variation of &quot;Here is an arena, kill everything.&quot; Yes it was D&amp;D 3.5, how did you guess? From there I went on to Shadowrun and then Exalted. I think that what drew me to Exalted is that there was actual though put into how fluff and crunch interacted which is actually rare for RPG's. (&quot;Men, here we are going to build a castle.&quot; &quot;But Sir, 90% of everything that we would want a castle to defend against can either fly, stick to walls, or phase though solid objects. What is the use of a castle?&quot; &quot;Because the fluff demands that there be castles in this setting! Now get to work.&quot;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1882-ghost","name":"Ghost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1882_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T08:31:10-07:00","id":972542,"title":"","content":"Hey I'm Raval, i'm new here. this is actually my first post. Exalted caught my eye a while back, the Infernals specifically. Which brings me to my question, are we still allowed to post 2e homebrew, like DTs and Infernal charms and stuff?.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5","name":"DArchon5","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T08:36:41-07:00","id":972545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DArchon5</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=972542#post972542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey I'm Raval, i'm new here. this is actually my first post. Exalted caught my eye a while back, the Infernals specifically. Which brings me to my question, are we still allowed to post 2e homebrew, like DTs and Infernal charms and stuff?.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, just because Ex3 dropped doesn't mean all previous editions are anathema conversation topics. We got quite a few Infernal fans here. Just be sure to mark the topics as 2nd Edition topics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T16:43:13-07:00","id":976795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DArchon5</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=972542#post972542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey I'm Raval, i'm new here. this is actually my first post. Exalted caught my eye a while back, the Infernals specifically. Which brings me to my question, are we still allowed to post 2e homebrew, like DTs and Infernal charms and stuff?.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please do post. I still have not digested or comprehended 3E yet, and since I have no play group and Infernals are my favorite, I think partly in 2E terms. I dunno if I'm the only one, but 2E shouldn't be a forbidden topic here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T13:42:37-07:00","id":977362,"title":"","content":"I guess I post enough on these forums to merit some kind of post here.<br /> <br /> I'm ParanoiaCombo, or just PC for short, and I chose this name to remind me that no matter how much I believe gamers overvalue systems in games, there are times when a system is so broken as to inflect the culture of a game so severely it might be worth a 2nd look at. Also because it wasn't taken yet, surprisingly. I've been playing games since 1988, since I was 8, which is a long time I guess. I started playing WW games at the ripe old age of 13 with the VtM 1st edition corebook, and I still remember the feeling that this was &quot;different&quot; from what I was used to.<br /> <br /> I like to argue about games, primarily, because the stakes are so low. Lately though, I'm beginning to re-evaluate that opinion in light of internet culture and fandom culture in general. As you may have noticed, I have strong opinions about games and game culture in general. I'm kind of an asshole. Sorry about that, genuinely.<br /> <br /> I wear a lot of hats in life. I am, in no particular order, an ESL teacher, a freelance writer, a balance/play experience consultant for a bunch of game companies usually but not restricted to the Fighting variety, and I do some security gigs on the side for a private company. I am also an occasional crisis counselor and have a hobby of taking in stray humans and helping them out, oftentimes to my own financial detriment, but man.. sometimes you can't let fucked up things slide. Aside from that, my day job is cleaning up the mess from the 2007 housing market crash in Massachusetts, which is a fancy way of saying, I check paperwork and sometimes foreclose on houses. It sucks.<br /> <br /> I playtested on EX3, and I think it's a good game, but not a game I want to play. I won't get into that here. That's not what this thread is for.<br /> <br /> Random Facts: My favorite color is sky blue, and my favorite fictional character is Ryu from Street Fighter. I also like to hike, often, because if you quit climbing a mountain halfway, you still have to climb down. I like getting angry PM's from people. People tell me I look like the kind of guy who would stomp you in the ribs behind an Applebees if I caught you hitting your SO on date night. Verbatim.<br /> <br /> Ok, I think that about it sums it up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Incentive is not permission or justification.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/255-paranoiacombo","name":"ParanoiaCombo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar255_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T20:41:43-07:00","id":983728,"title":"","content":"i've been wondering. I found all these references to Infernals Nuke-Punching stuff, but i cant figure out what the charms used are. I'm not very familiar with Feats of Strength or Sorcery but i wanted to ask you guys if you know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5","name":"DArchon5","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T20:48:39-07:00","id":983733,"title":"","content":"That's probably a question for the Ask A Question, Get an Answer thread, but my offhand guess is something in the Green Sun Nimbus Flare cascade.<br /> <br /> Edit: <a href=\"http://ninjasensei.wikidot.com/yozi:malfeas\" target=\"_blank\">Here you go</a>. Depending on how radioactive you want &quot;nuke&quot; to be that's Green Sun Nimbus Flare, Cold Fire Desolation Brand, and/or Radiant Fury Dissolution. Burns, radiation sickness and horrible death, and mushroom clouds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied 