?p=1003297#post1003297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So say we all! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't say all... probably not even most, or many. Such is the way of 2e's burn through good will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T03:20:01-08:00","id":1003840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=1003414#post1003414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wouldn't say all... probably not even most, or many. Such is the way of 2e's burn through good will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Im not familiar with the beef against 2nd Ed, other than &quot;Tone of lore rapidly alternating, leading to a lot of contradictions.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12669-kanonite","name":"Kanonite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12669_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T10:52:56-08:00","id":1004008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kanonite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=1003840#post1003840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Im not familiar with the beef against 2nd Ed, other than &quot;Tone of lore rapidly alternating, leading to a lot of contradictions.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>We have <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/363772-after-all-these-days-exalted-2nd-edition\">a thread</a> for that. It doesn't mention some particularly egregious low-points, though (2e's version of Ma-Ha-Suchi and his Nameless Lair, or the House of Succulent Tears, for example).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T14:03:42-08:00","id":1004108,"title":"","content":"It's kinda late for this, but I suppose I might as well introduce myself before I hit the 100's posts mark.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Hello, I'm raaabr! And yeah, even I don't know how you're supposed to pronounce that, but I usually default to &quot;Rah-Ber&quot;. Anyways, I'm a relative newbie to RPGs (I've only really played for two years, though I am part of a number of long running campaigns, one of which is Exalted 3rd Edition). I joined the forum because I figured it'd be a nice resource for any lore questions and workshop stuff I wanna do. And I love theorycrafting characters besides the ones I currently play.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">BEHOLD! GLORIOUS SOLAR MONKEY!</span><br /> <br /> <br /> My avatar was made by <b>Jen!</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12377-raaabr","name":"raaabr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12377_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T15:48:01-08:00","id":1009071,"title":"","content":"I go by Sagara, or sometimes Queldan for my latest major PC. I'm currently GMing a 3e Exalted game that's nearly a year old now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T15:14:22-08:00","id":1016271,"title":"","content":"I'm Tai, I've been playing tabletop since I was a wee one because my dad got me into it. Pleasure to meetcha! Joined to get some feedback on some artifacts I brewed up and see if I could find a game!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12745-taimageblade","name":"TaiMageBlade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T23:37:50-08:00","id":1017518,"title":"","content":"Molotove here, just started playing 2e with a few friends, likely converting on to 3e after the next story. I'm a big sucker for games with comprehensive settings so Exalted and all its 1e and 2e books are like crack for me. I came here for crafting arguments, mostly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12603-molotove","name":"Molotove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T21:09:29-08:00","id":1019598,"title":"","content":"Hello Community! I'm Vanderkrad, I obvsessibly played 2nd edition and loved the Lunars and their tragic story, lately I've been playing 3rd edition with a new group and so far I like it but I miss the tick system for combat from 2nd ed. I will be here bothering with some questions about 3rd edition and asking for some suggestions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12585-vanderkrad","name":"Vanderkrad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date: