 am also a forty something queer woman from France (fairly boring hair though) who started playing Exalted back in first edition. Currently running Essence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2314-salinea","name":"salinea","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}